    reason: "Backlog edited after v1 commit b26b45b (32 changed lines): lines 385, 393, 400, 409 and 414 gained an approval tag or note on other candidate pitches; bullets 537-538 now name moved pitch files; 18 lines were appended. This pitch's own followups, lines 462-468, are unchanged (lines 443-523 hash equal)."
